<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>開發者專區 Premier 帳戶已核准</title>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<style type ="text/css">/* IE8 COMPENSATE FOR HTML5 COMPATIBILITY */ article, aside, figure, caption, figcaption, footer, header, main, nav, section, summary { display: block; } /* STRUCTURE */ body { -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; background-color:#f9f9f9; background: url('https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png') repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9; height: 100%; outline: medium none; } #container { /* "Container" contains all the layout code, sets page width in (pixels), and easily centers page. */ width: 600px; /* Good width of the vast majority of computer screens - 960px is standard because most users have 1024×768 resolution or higher */ margin-top: 10px; /* Outside the container line */ margin-right: auto; /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */ margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: auto; /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */ position: relative; /* "relative" because using things called floats */ /* position options {"relative", "absolute"} */ background-color: #FFFFFF; border-color: #E5E5E5; border-style: solid; padding: 25px 50px 0px 50px; /*top right bottom left -- Inside the container line */ border-width: 1px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 1.5em; } hr { background-color: #E5E5E5; color:#E5E5E5; border: 0 none; height: 1px; } img.floating { /* image with text around it */ float: right; padding: 4px 0px 0px 50px; /** top right bottom left **/ } /* TEXT STYLES */ body { font-family: "Intel Clear", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666; } header { font-family: "Intel Clear Pro", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1.1em; color: #003C71; line-height: 2em; } section { font-size: 0.8em; font-style: italic; color: black; line-height: 1.4em; } footer { font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4em; } footer a { text-decoration: none; } a { color: #086DB6; } .intelBlueTextStyle { color: #086DB6; } .subjectTextStyle { font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; color: #086DB6; line-height: 1.4em; }</style>
</head>


<body>
<div id="container"><header>
<h1><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/5104bda0-0fc2-11ec-901e-3750230d5760.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" width="700" height="156" /></h1>
<hr /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><!-- horizontal line --></span></header><main>
<p class="subjectTextStyle"><span face="intel clear, sans-serif" style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;">歡迎來到開發者專區 Premier</span></p>
<p><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">歡迎 {!Contact.Name}，</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">您已註冊開發者專區 Premier 帳戶。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">您開發者專區 Premier 帳戶的申請已核准。請使用這個<a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/design/confidential/restricted-documents.html">連結</a>登入 Intel&reg; 開發者專區。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">已為這個帳戶配置開發者專區 Premier 存取權：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><b>電子郵件地址：</b> <span class="intelBlueTextStyle">{!Contact.Email}</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">請保留此封電子郵件以供日後參考。</span></p>
</main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">請確實保護您的密碼，不要外洩。您使用密碼和  Intel 網站時，必須遵守 Intel 的使用條款。各網站網頁最下方均有使用條款的連結。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">如果您有任何疑問，請<a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/forms/support/my-intel-sign-on-support.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">與我們聯絡</a>。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">若要管理您的個人檔案，包括可用的行銷訂閱，請造訪 <a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/secure/my-intel/profile.html" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">My Intel</a>。</span></p>
<main>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;">請勿回覆此電子郵件訊息。此郵件為系統自動傳送。為確保您可以繼續收到我們的電子郵件，請將我們加進您的通訊錄。</span></p>
</main>
<section>
<p style="text-align: right;"></p>
</section>
<hr /><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><img class="floating" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png" alt="Intel 圖誌" height="42" width="64" />Intel 承諾保護您的隱私權。如需更多資訊，請參閱 <a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html">Intel 隱私權聲明</a>。<a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html">Intel Cookie 注意事項</a>。</span><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/terms-of-use.html">法律聲明</a> &verbar; <a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/trademarks.html">商標</a> <span style="font-size: 1em;">&copy;</span> Intel Corporation。</span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer><footer><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></footer></div>
<p><span style="font-family: 'intel clear', sans-serif;"></span></p>
</body>
</html>